{"html": "<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 05 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">自监督学习：对比、聚类、自蒸馏与遮挡重建</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Self-Supervised Learning</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_025_moco-title\">MoCo</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">由 EMA key encoder 维护一致编码、由 FIFO queue 提供大规模跨 batch 负样本的对比字典。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Decouples contrastive negative dictionary size from mini-batch size using a FIFO queue of encoded keys updated via a momentum (EMA) encoder.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">同一图像的 query 与 key 增强视图</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Query view x^q and key view x^k of the same image</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">对比预训练后的 query encoder 表征</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Contrastively pretrained query encoder representation</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 2(a–c) · PDF p.3</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始方法示意图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content_CVPR_2020/html/He_Momentum_Contrast_for_Unsupervised_Visual_Representation_Learning_CVPR_2020_paper.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_025_moco')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_025_moco')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"MoCo original paper architecture figure, Figure 2(a–c)\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/e26117f5da2a657f071e.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 2(a–c) · PDF p.3</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 9 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_025_moco', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_025_moco\" onclick=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_025_moco')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_025_moco', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_025_moco\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 09 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">Query 视图</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Query</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">第一随机增强作为当前 mini-batch 的查询。</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests query view x^q and key view x^k of the same image and prepares initial tensor representations (Query).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"第一随机增强作为当前 mini-batch 的查询。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests query view x^q and key view x^k of the same image and prepares initial tensor representations (Query).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"Query 视图\" data-node-name-en=\"Query\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_025_moco', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">Query 视图</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Query</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">第一随机增强作为当前 mini-batch 的查询。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests query view x^q and key view x^k of the same image and prepares initial tensor representations (Query).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"第二随机增强作为与 query 匹配的正 key。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Key to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"Key 视图\" data-node-name-en=\"Key\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_025_moco', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">Key 视图</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Key</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">第二随机增强作为与 query 匹配的正 key。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Key to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"由损失直接反向传播更新的主编码器。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Query Encoder within the core momentum dual encoder queue computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"Query Encoder\" data-node-name-en=\"Query Encoder\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_025_moco', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Query Encoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">由损失直接反向传播更新的主编码器。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Query Encoder within the core momentum dual encoder queue computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"参数是 query encoder 参数的指数移动平均，不接收梯度。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Momentum Encoder within the core momentum dual encoder queue computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"Momentum Encoder\" data-node-name-en=\"Momentum Encoder\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_025_moco', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Momentum Encoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">参数是 query encoder 参数的指数移动平均，不接收梯度。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Momentum Encoder within the core momentum dual encoder queue computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"FIFO 字典保存跨多个 mini-batch 的已编码负 key。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Key Queue within the core momentum dual encoder queue computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"Key Queue\" data-node-name-en=\"Key Queue\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_025_moco', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Key Queue</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">FIFO 字典保存跨多个 mini-batch 的已编码负 key。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Key Queue within the core momentum dual encoder queue computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"query 与正 key 及队列负 key 的归一化点积形成 logits。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Logits within the core momentum dual encoder queue computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"点积 Logits\" data-node-name-en=\"Logits\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_025_moco', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">点积 Logits</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Logits</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">query 与正 key 及队列负 key 的归一化点积形成 logits。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Logits within the core momentum dual encoder queue computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"辨认匹配 key 的对比交叉熵只更新 query 分支。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs InfoNCE within the core momentum dual encoder queue computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"InfoNCE\" data-node-name-en=\"InfoNCE\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_025_moco', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>InfoNCE</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">辨认匹配 key 的对比交叉熵只更新 query 分支。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs InfoNCE within the core momentum dual encoder queue computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"θ_k ← mθ_k +(1−m)θ_q，使字典中的 key 编码保持一致。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies EMA update to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"EMA 更新\" data-node-name-en=\"EMA update\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_025_moco', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">EMA 更新</span><span class=\"lang-en\">EMA update</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">θ_k ← mθ_k +(1−m)θ_q，使字典中的 key 编码保持一致。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies EMA update to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"预训练后导出 query encoder 进行微调。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces contrastively pretrained query encoder representation via Encoder.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"下游 Encoder\" data-node-name-en=\"Encoder\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_025_moco', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">下游 Encoder</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Encoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">预训练后导出 query encoder 进行微调。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces contrastively pretrained query encoder representation via Encoder.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"MoCo Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · MoCo 动量 key encoder 与 FIFO 字典更新</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Momentum-Updated Key Encoder &amp; FIFO Queue Contrastive Dictionary</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"MoCo：核心公式 · MoCo 动量 key encoder 与 FIFO 字典更新\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"25\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"10.818498pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.593865 -69.120887 239.020861 10.818498\" width=\"239.020861pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M4.258005-.972691L4.109124-1.081871C4.059497-.992542 4.00987-.903213 3.960242-.82381C3.781585-.516122 3.66248-.40694