.282109\"></use><use x=\"78.289234\" xlink:href=\"#m025_g14-110\" y=\"-61.282109\"></use><use x=\"83.270554\" xlink:href=\"#m025_g14-113\" y=\"-61.282109\"></use><use x=\"88.152242\" xlink:href=\"#m025_g14-117\" y=\"-61.282109\"></use><use x=\"93.133562\" xlink:href=\"#m025_g14-101\" y=\"-61.282109\"></use><use x=\"97.556977\" xlink:href=\"#m025_g14-117\" y=\"-61.282109\"></use><use x=\"102.538297\" xlink:href=\"#m025_g14-101\" y=\"-61.282109\"></use><use x=\"107.459845\" xlink:href=\"#m025_g4-185\" y=\"-61.282109\"></use><use x=\"111.375163\" xlink:href=\"#m025_g4-81\" y=\"-61.282109\"></use><use x=\"118.936805\" xlink:href=\"#m025_g10-150\" y=\"-61.282109\"></use><use x=\"123.605911\" xlink:href=\"#m025_g10-58\" y=\"-61.282109\"></use><use x=\"128.826317\" xlink:href=\"#m025_g1-184\" y=\"-65.396669\"></use><use x=\"133.949895\" xlink:href=\"#m025_g4-186\" y=\"-61.282109\"></use><use x=\"139.979437\" xlink:href=\"#m025_g4-110\" y=\"-61.282109\"></use><use x=\"146.776118\" xlink:href=\"#m025_g14-111\" y=\"-61.282109\"></use><use x=\"151.757438\" xlink:href=\"#m025_g14-108\" y=\"-61.282109\"></use><use x=\"154.527051\" xlink:href=\"#m025_g14-100\" y=\"-61.282109\"></use><use x=\"159.508371\" xlink:href=\"#m025_g14-101\" y=\"-61.282109\"></use><use x=\"163.931786\" xlink:href=\"#m025_g14-115\" y=\"-61.282109\"></use><use x=\"167.657803\" xlink:href=\"#m025_g14-116\" y=\"-61.282109\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">SimCLR 的负样本规模与 batch size 强绑定</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">End-to-end contrastive learning (SimCLR) required massive multi-GPU batch sizes to supply sufficient negative samples.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">用 momentum encoder 与 queue 构造大而一致的动态负样本字典</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Maintain a large dynamic dictionary queue of negative embeddings encoded by a slowly progressing Exponential Moving Average (EMA) key encoder.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">EMA 更新 key encoder，把字典规模从当前 batch 解耦</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">EMA key parameter update θ_k ← m θ_k + (1−m) θ_q paired with an enqueue/dequeue FIFO memory bank.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">适合医学小 batch、患者级采样和算力受限 SSL</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Well-suited for compute-constrained 2D/3D medical contrastive pretraining where GPU memory restricts batch size.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">经典实现；其 momentum/EMA teacher 思想被后续方法继承，queue 本身并非统一模板</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Classic contrastive mechanism; its EMA teacher principle directly informed BYOL, DINO, and modern SSL.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">动态队列把负样本字典大小与 mini-batch 大小解耦。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">动量更新使当前 key encoder 与队列中历史 key 的表示缓慢漂移，保持字典一致。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">只有 query encoder 接收梯度，key 分支是在线生成稳定训练目标的教师。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Maintain a large dynamic dictionary queue of negative embeddings encoded by a slowly progressing Exponential Moving Average (EMA) key encoder.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: EMA key parameter update θ_k ← m θ_k + (1−m) θ_q paired with an enqueue/dequeue FIFO memory bank.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Momentum-Updated Key Encoder &amp; FIFO Queue Contrastive Dictionary.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">队列降低 3D 医学影像对超大 batch 的依赖，但患者级去重仍是避免假负样本的关键。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">动量表征适合跨扫描仪和跨中心预训练；队列中域分布严重失衡时可能学到中心身份。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Well-suited for compute-constrained 2D/3D medical contrastive pretraining where GPU memory restricts batch size.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Classic contrastive mechanism; its EMA teacher principle directly informed BYOL, DINO, and modern SSL.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content_CVPR_2020/html/He_Momentum_Contrast_for_Unsupervised_Visual_Representation_Learning_CVPR_2020_paper.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>Momentum Contrast for Unsupervised Visual Representation Learning</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/facebookresearch/moco\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}